<overview>
<p>The Free Worlds League Military has long fielded some of the largest infantry formations in the Inner Sphere, with regiments numbering nearly 1,800 soldiers compared to roughly 750 in the Combine and just over 1,000 in the Federated Suns. Deploying Sniper cannon, a direct-fire variant of the standard Sniper artillery piece, these platoons trade indirect capability for accuracy and responsiveness against targets within line of sight.</p>
</overview>

<notes>
Intro date based on production date of artillery cannons
